  "$yearNote": "2025 ruleset: Packet OW-2 (rev. 11-2024) percentage tables, 0.25% to 4.75% above $6,350 single / $12,700 married a year after $1,000 per allowance. Per-period thresholds are the annual ones divided by the number of periods and rounded to the dollar, with each base the annual base divided by the periods and rounded to the cent, which reproduces every printed row checked (e.g. semi-monthly married: $12.79 + 4.75% over $1,129)."
